{"title":"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of each of the four congruent L-shaped regions of this 100-inch by 100-inch square is 3/16 of the total area.  How many inches long is the side of the center square?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/a/a1a3a520aef5349391bdc7054d86229bbbe3bfcc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((2,2)--(2,-2)--(-2,-2)--(-2,2)--cycle); draw((1,1)--(1,-1)--(-1,-1)--(-1,1)--cycle); draw((0,1)--(0,2)); draw((1,0)--(2,0)); draw((0,-1)--(0,-2)); draw((-1,0)--(-2,0)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/7/68731bf74cacf55ccb3863321d06f9c3a0642a38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 25 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 44 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 50 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 62 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"375\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area taken up by the L's is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/9/329c6f7ecc89a2eba2b0193052bb41a962e7aed6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4*\\frac{3}{16}=\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"84\" height=\"38\" /> of the area of the whole square. What remains has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c339afa03e060d959e4942be7522c0c992f4c41c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> of the area of the larger square. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/c/2dcb0ed3d4818b10af9c2ce7c6d5730f46e495c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100*100}{4}=\\frac{100}{2}*\\frac{100}{2}=50*50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"256\" height=\"38\" /> is the area of the smaller square, so its side length is 50. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/8/988a15926640244e366e55b6e468af2e3e60047e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME\" title=\"1995 AJHSME\">1995 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title